[10.520283, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[31mnvsh:\u001b[0m trtexec --version failed (exit 127)\r\n"]
[34.110837, "o", "**Diagnosis**\r\n"]
[34.174109, "o", "- Exit code 12"]
[34.227436, "o", "7 means `command not found"]
[34.285327, "o", "`. The shell"]
[34.342748, "o", " could"]
[34.401398, "o", " not locate `trtexec"]
[34.45894, "o", "`.\r\n- `trtexec"]
[34.513846, "o", "` is the command"]
[34.570872, "o", "-line tool"]
[34.626189, "o", " included"]
[34.679445, "o", " with"]
[34.731414, "o", " **"]
[34.786899, "o", "NVIDIA TensorRT**."]
[34.841813, "o", " The platform inspection confirms"]
[34.899208, "o", " Tensor"]
[34.955043, "o", "RT is not present"]
[35.01179, "o", " on this"]
[35.070329, "o", " system: `tensorrt"]
[35.126345, "o", "_version: absent [subprocess"]
[35.182108, "o", ": dpkg-query -W"]
[35.242018, "o", "]`.\r\n- Supporting"]
[35.299887, "o", " metadata is"]
[35.353575, "o", " also missing"]
[35.407592, "o", ": `"]
[35.466739, "o", "cuda_version:"]
[35.518462, "o", " absent`, `c"]
[35.576741, "o", "udnn_version: absent`."]
[35.631633, "o", " The N"]
[35.687291, "o", "VIDIA driver is active"]
[35.742939, "o", " (`595.7"]
[35.801333, "o", "8`), and"]
[35.854517, "o", " L4T R39"]
[35.913702, "o", " is running on Jet"]
[35.967849, "o", "son AG"]
[36.024387, "o", "X"]
[36.080805, "o", " Orin, but the Tensor"]
[36.135067, "o", "RT runtime"]
[36.191957, "o", " and"]
[36.248549, "o", " toolkit packages"]
[36.305562, "o", " were never"]
[36.366097, "o", " installed or"]
[36.422087, "o", " were removed"]
[36.47867, "o", ".\r\n"]
[36.535759, "o", "- As"]
[36.592482, "o", " a result, `trtex"]
[36.645515, "o", "ec` is not in `$"]
[36.700516, "o", "PATH` and has"]
[36.75571, "o", " no binary on"]
[36.811683, "o", " disk"]
[36.866786, "o", ".\r\n\r\n**Fix ("]
[36.923034, "o", "read-only inspection first"]
[36.977477, "o", ")**\r\n1"]
[37.033462, "o", ". **Verify"]
[37.08963, "o", " the binary"]
[37.143658, "o", " location"]
[37.200017, "o", "**"]
[37.258975, "o", " (if you"]
[37.313673, "o", " later"]
[37.373033, "o", " install"]
[37.428496, "o", " TensorRT): `"]
[37.485242, "o", "trtexec` is"]
[37.541982, "o", " typically deployed"]
[37.599394, "o", " to"]
[37.654932, "o", " `/usr/lib/aarch6"]
[37.711575, "o", "4-linux-gnu"]
[37.769404, "o", "/trtexec` on"]
[37.825104, "o", " Jet"]
[37.881221, "o", "son platforms"]
[37.937755, "o", ".\r\n2. **Check for"]
[37.993427, "o", " a"]
[38.051037, "o", " partial or"]
[38.107278, "o", " mis"]
[38.165556, "o", "placed install"]
[38.219673, "o", "**: Run"]
[38.274959, "o", " `find"]
[38.329802, "o", " / -"]
[38.387071, "o", "name tr"]
[38.443361, "o", "texec "]
[38.497846, "o", "2>/dev/null` to"]
[38.554115, "o", " see if it"]
[38.608644, "o", " exists elsewhere ("]
[38.66208, "o", "e.g., a"]
[38.717368, "o", " user"]
[38.771473, "o", " build"]
[38.829569, "o", " or sym"]
[38.886159, "o", "link).\r\n"]
[38.943425, "o", "3. **Install TensorRT"]
[38.998003, "o", " for L4T R3"]
[39.054349, "o", "9**: Since"]
[39.111136, "o", " `dp"]
[39.168554, "o", "kg-query` reports"]
[39.226469, "o", " no TensorRT package"]
[39.284869, "o", ", install"]
[39.340602, "o", " the version"]
[39.397513, "o", " compatible with the observed"]
[39.449108, "o", " `"]
[39.504108, "o", "l4t_release: R"]
[39.559505, "o", "39` and `n"]
[39.614996, "o", "vidia_smi_driver_version:"]
[39.675075, "o", " 595.7"]
[39.729988, "o", "8`. On"]
[39.782579, "o", " Jet"]
[39.840919, "o", "son, the"]
[39.897163, "o", " recommended path"]
[39.95117, "o", " is:\r\n   ```bash\r\n"]
[40.005699, "o", "   sudo apt-get update\r\n"]
[40.059727, "o", "   sudo apt-get install tensor"]
[40.114735, "o", "rt\r\n   ```\r\n   This"]
[40.17096, "o", " pulls the L"]
[40.223889, "o", "4T-matched"]
[40.280641, "o", " TensorRT runtime"]
[40.338575, "o", " that includes `trtex"]
[40.39544, "o", "ec`, `"]
[40.450468, "o", "onn"]
[40.505168, "o", "x2"]
[40.562406, "o", "tr"]
[40.62321, "o", "t"]
[40.679453, "o", "`, and related"]
[40.73808, "o", " tools"]
[40.796169, "o", ".\r\n4. **Confirm"]
[40.851846, "o", " installation"]
[40.912231, "o", "**: After installing"]
[40.968499, "o", ", `which"]
[41.026525, "o", " trtexec` should resolve"]
[41.084026, "o", " to the"]
[41.139507, "o", " binary"]
[41.196307, "o", ", and `tr"]
[41.250707, "o", "texec --version` should"]
[41.309113, "o", " return the Tensor"]
[41.362997, "o", "RT version without exit"]
[41.417985, "o", " code 127"]
[41.475438, "o", ".\r\n\r\nIf package"]
[41.531396, "o", " installation is not"]
[41.585145, "o", " possible, note"]
[41.639024, "o", " that `trtexec`"]
[41.696153, "o", " is specific"]
[41.752523, "o", " to TensorRT."]
[41.807156, "o", " For inference-only"]
[41.86246, "o", " workload"]
[41.916952, "o", "s,"]
[41.968655, "o", " consider `onn"]
[42.019556, "o", "xruntime"]
[42.076734, "o", "` or `torch-"]
[42.132691, "o", "export"]
[42.190981, "o", "` based"]
[42.249497, "o", " tools"]
[42.309189, "o", " as"]
[42.366089, "o", " alternatives, but restoring"]
[42.416642, "o", " `trtexec` requires"]
[42.471452, "o", " the TensorRT package"]
[42.526094, "o", " matching your"]
[42.578484, "o", " L4T/d"]
[42.636968, "o", "river configuration"]
[42.694311, "o", ".\r\n"]
[42.735558, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b]0;orin@orin: ~\u0007orin@orin:~$ "]
